      "title": "Protean Egov Technologies Limited Announces Suresh Sethi Resignation as Managing Director, Effective March 31, 2026",
      "body": "Protean eGov Technologies Limited announced that Mr. Suresh Sethi, has tendered his resignation from the position of Managing Director on January 16, 2026 to pursue other interests and his last working day shall be March 31, 2026. effect from close of business hours on March 31, 2026. Consequently, he shall also cease to be a Member of all the Committees where he is a Member with effect from close of business hours on March 31, 2026, or\nany earlier date of reconstitution of Committees by the Board.",
